::  mar/lattice/forum-note: a forum refusal note. Two shapes travel under
::  it: the [board reason] a host pokes back at an actor, and the
::  [host board reason at] the actor stores under /forum/notes. The
::  handlers mold each one themselves, so the mark takes any noun.
::
|_  non=*
++  grad  %noun
++  grow
  |%
  ++  noun  non
  --
++  grab
  |%
  ++  noun  *
  --
--
